---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import Demo from '../components/Demo.astro';import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';import {getContent} from '../lib/content';const {faqs,posts}=await getContent();
---
<Layout><section class="hero grid-paper"><a class="announcement" href="/how-it-works/"><span>MEET VANKA</span> Your website’s next conversation starts here <b>↗</b></a><h1>You paid for the visit.<br/><em>Don’t lose the visitor.</em></h1><p class="hero-copy">Turn “just looking” into a real conversation.<br/>Vankard installs and runs the AI sales layer that helps your<br class="desktop"/> existing traffic take the next step.</p><div class="hero-actions"><button class="button" data-chat>Find out if we fit <span>↗</span></button><a class="button secondary" href="/demo/">See it in action <span>→</span></a></div><div class="hero-meta"><span><i></i> Built for businesses with existing traffic</span><span>Installed in 48 hours*</span></div><Demo/></section><div class="outcome-strip"><span>MORE FROM THE TRAFFIC YOU HAVE</span><b>Useful conversations</b><i>+</i><b>Qualified interest</b><i>+</i><b>A clearer next step</b></div><section class="section definition"><span class="eyebrow">What is Vankard?</span><h2>A managed AI sales layer<br/>for your <em>existing website traffic.</em></h2><p>Vankard helps businesses turn website visits into qualified conversations and meetings. We install and manage Vanka AI, write scripts for your offer, connect your CRM and tune the visitor experience.</p><p><strong>Who it is for:</strong> businesses that already attract relevant website visitors and use sales conversations or consultations to win customers. <strong>Where you start:</strong> Recover, followed by qualification for Optimize and Scale.</p><a class="text-link" href="/pricing/">Review Recover pricing and inclusions ↗</a></section><section class="section split"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 / The expensive silence</span><h2>Your best prospect<br/>doesn’t always<br/><em>fill in the form.</em></h2></div><div class="section-copy"><p class="large">They compare. They hesitate.<br/>They have one last question.</p><p>And if nobody answers, they leave. Your analytics records a visit. Your sales team never sees a conversation.</p><p>Buying another click won’t answer the question that stopped the last one.</p><a class="text-link" href="/how-it-works/">Fix what happens after the click ↗</a></div></section><section class="section mechanism"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">02 / The intent-to-conversation layer</span><h2>Be there when<br/><em>interest turns into intent.</em></h2></div><p>Vanka brings the next step into the moment.<br/>You bring the offer. We build the conversation.</p></div><div class="three-grid process"><article><span class="step-num">[ 01 ]</span><div class="process-art radar"><div>◎</div><span class="floating-label">Pricing page · Return visit</span></div><h3>Notice the moment.</h3><p>Use relevant visitor context to help decide when a conversation would be useful.</p></article><article><span class="step-num">[ 02 ]</span><div class="process-art bubbles"><span>“Is this right for us?”</span><span>Let’s find out together. ↗</span></div><h3>Answer the real question.</h3><p>Offer-specific conversations help visitors understand, qualify themselves and move forward.</p></article><article><span class="step-num">[ 03 ]</span><div class="process-art calendar"><span>THE NEXT STEP</span><strong>Let’s talk.</strong><div>✓ &nbsp; Qualified conversation</div></div><h3>Make room for the sale.</h3><p>Help suitable visitors arrange a meeting and keep the context connected to your CRM.</p></article></div></section><section class="dark-section"><div><span class="eyebrow">The Vankard philosophy</span><h2>More traffic is a multiplier.<br/><em>Fix what it’s multiplying.</em></h2><p>A growth system should earn the right to scale. Start by recovering<br class="desktop"/> missed conversations. Improve the experience. Then grow demand.</p><a class="button" href="/solutions/">Meet your growth sequence ↗</a></div><div class="sequence"><a href="/solutions/#recover"><span>01</span><strong>Recover</strong><small>Start with existing demand</small><b>↗</b></a><a href="/solutions/#optimize"><span>02</span><strong>Optimize</strong><small>Improve what happens next</small><b>↗</b></a><a href="/solutions/#scale"><span>03</span><strong>Scale</strong><small>Grow when the system is ready</small><b>↗</b></a></div></section><section class="section split brief-section"><div class="brief"><div class="browser-bar"><span>VANKARD / MORNING BRIEF</span><span>05:00</span></div><div class="brief-content"><span class="eyebrow">Illustrative brief</span><h3>Your morning.<br/>Minus the guesswork.</h3><p><span class="signal"></span> Conversations that moved forward</p><p><span class="signal"></span> Questions worth paying attention to</p><p><span class="signal"></span> Where your team needs to step in</p><small>No dashboard archaeology required.</small></div></div><div><span class="eyebrow">Managed, not left to you</span><h2>You run the business.<br/><em>We run the layer.</em></h2><p>Installation. Offer-specific scripts. CRM connection. Live tuning. Vankard handles the work behind the conversation, then summarizes what needs your attention.</p><a class="text-link" href="/pricing/">See what’s included in Recover ↗</a></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Field notes</span><h2>A different way<br/>to think about <em>growth.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Explore the insights ↗</a></div><div class="three-grid">{posts.slice(0,3).map((p,i)=><a class="article-card" href={`/blog/${p.slug}/`}><div class={`article-art art-${i}`}><span>{['↗','“ ”','01 → 03'][i]}</span><small>VANKARD / FIELD NOTES</small></div><span class="eyebrow">{p.category} · {p.readTime}</span><h3>{p.title}</h3><p>{p.excerpt}</p><span class="text-link">Read the article ↗</span></a>)}</div></section><section class="section faq-section"><div><span class="eyebrow">A few things, answered</span><h2>Before we<br/><em>start talking.</em></h2><a class="text-link" href="/faq/">All your questions ↗</a></div><div>{faqs.slice(0,5).map(f=><details><summary>{f.question}</summary><p>{f.answer}</p></details>)}</div></section><CTA/><div class="footnote">*48-hour installation begins once required access, offer information and approvals are available.</div></Layout>
